{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0160","paragraphs":[{"id":"ped8c7f3c2fb0-1","text":"一曲新词酒一杯。"},{"id":"pdcf3c0189724-1","text":"去年天气旧亭台。"},{"id":"p22537c479084-1","text":"夕阳西下几时回。"},{"id":"pada00456f878-1","text":"无可奈何花落去，似曾相识燕归来。"},{"id":"p4c6f65b7d8c3-1","text":"小园香径独徘徊。"}]}